    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n43402" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">sellāris</span></b> , e, adj.
		sella, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>of</i> or <i>belonging to a seat</i>
			(post-class.): 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">gestatio,</span>”
				<i>in a sedan</i>,
				 <i><span class="en">Cael.
						Aur. Tard. 1, 4, 92</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">jumenta,</span>”
				<i>furnished with saddles</i>, <i>used for
					riding</i>,
				 <i><span class="en">Veg. 2, 28, 34</span></i>
			; <i><span class="en">6, 7, 5</span></i>.—<i>Subst.</i>:
				<b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">sellāris</span></b> ,
				is, m., <i>a
			saddlehorse</i>, Vit. <i><span class="en">Caes. Arel. 2, 2,
			20</span></i>.</div>
